    "Odds: jackpot 1 in 21.2 per spin. Expected return is about 96% in the gold zone and lower at other strengths.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "概率：每转中奖率 1/21.2。金色区下的期望返还约 96%，其他力度更低。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One coin buys one ball. Drag the spring launcher down and let go to shoot; AUTO keeps shooting at your last strength. Pull into the gold zone for the best shots. Balls that fall short come back for free.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一枚金币买一颗珠。把弹簧拉杆往下拉、松手就发射；「自动」会按上一发的力度连续打。拉到金色那一段最好打。太轻掉回来的珠子不扣币。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One more fruit lamp!": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "再亮一盏水果灯就满了！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Out of balls. Add more?": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "珠子打完了，再来点？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Out of coins? Watch a short ad for 50.": {
