    "Pick a chip, tap the table to place bets, then tap SPIN. You can bet up to 50 coins per spin.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选一个筹码，点台面下注，再点 SPIN。每局最多下注 50 枚金币。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Place your bets!": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请下注！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pockets: the center start pocket pays 1 and spins the reels. Tulips pay 2 and open or close each time. Side pockets pay 1. The lucky cup sliding along the bottom pays 2.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "入口：中间的始动口赔 1 币并转一次数字盘。郁金香赔 2 币，每进一球开合一次。两侧袖口赔 1 币。底部来回滑动的幸运杯赔 2 币。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
